  ('production', 'Chris', 'Team,772-559-5569 This is my cellphone number, any deviation from your scheduled work day due to an emergency requires a call or text to me.  If you are requesting a day off for a non emergency please email me 30 days in advance at <mailto:chris@nashvilletaxsolutions.com|chris@nashvilletaxsolutions.com> Please confirm understanding.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-27T15:04:33+00:00'),
