  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'Averie', 'Thank you', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18T19:05:23+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'Isabela Pettingill', 'Where should I place Solar payments in a 433A?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:33:47+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Where are they on Housing and utilities? ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:34:13+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'Isabela Pettingill', 'Over the standard. We have supporting docs for it', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:35:08+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Are they 150% of the standard or are they over that?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:35:22+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'And what resoltuion are we going for?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:35:31+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'Isabela Pettingill', 'CNC or 25 a month... let me calculate that', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:35:51+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Dont worry about it, if we are going for CNC, put it in Secure debt', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:36:18+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'Isabela Pettingill', 'Okay - other secure debt not personal asset, right?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:36:49+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Right.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:36:58+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Typically we would put it in housing and utilities, but if he is already over the NS, they do not have to accept it. If we classify it as a secured debt, i.e. if they don''t make the payments they will remove the solar panels, or file a lien against the house, it now interferes with the equity of the primary residence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:39:01+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'alexandra', 'we use the three year average, csed calculation or streamline/non streamline only to calculate the offer correct....I''m having a hard time reading me notes from yesterday', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:39:06+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'No, we should doing it for every fin for a Self employed individual.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:40:21+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'alexandra', 'okay gotcha', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:40:35+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-soltuions-paras', 'alexandra', 'but these folks have w2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-28T14:40:51+00:00'),
