  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'A couple of images from the new Slack workflow.

*Note:* We can create workflows to take in information, and likewise automate where it ends up.  Think about where it would be easier for you to request someone just give you information here, and it ends up in the correct location.

It can insert lines to excel sheets... for example :slightly_smiling_face:', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-06T14:59:17+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'Thanks to those who joined the demo today.
*We Covered...*
1. Openers
    a. Their view and dashboards.
    b. Their view of their earnings
2. Closers
    a. Dashboards
    b. Client Entry Process
    c. Deal Entry Process
    d. Their view of their earnings
3. Sales Admin
    a. Client Approval
    b. Deal Approval/Turnover Prep
    c. Commissions Assignment
        i. Commissions + Bonus Rates Updates
    d. Payment Entry
    e. Additional Reporting and historical views
4. Associates
    a. Similar view to openers, but focused on the client and work.
    b. Can see their own deals/work and earnings
    c. Links direct back to Canopy
5. Production Admin
    a. Controls commissions for Associates
6. Various Admin pages, which we will house under an existing or new role.
Let''s get our requests and notes into a single thread, and we can get the improvements done as a fast-follow!

Have a great weekend everyone!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17T20:18:36+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'Some screenshots from some of the things we viewed today.

I''ll be cutting test users with scoped roles this weekend.  Look for an email!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-17T20:38:57+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'Just a reminder to @Casey Grimm @Averie @Isabela Pettingill
Get any notes or alterations you''d like.

Working on the updates to when a deal payment can be submitted/banked from `Approved` to `Pending`', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-20T13:29:55+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Isabela Pettingill', 'I will look through when I have time later today - playing a bit of catch-up', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-20T13:30:43+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'No worries!  We just need feedback to make improvements and get it (as close to) right the first time!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-20T13:38:35+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'Alright, I''ve figured out the "how."
Will be head down for a bit bringing this to life!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-20T14:59:56+00:00'),
  ('nts-technology-news', 'Dave - GSCS', 'Canopy has updated their interface.  They''ve introduced the concept of `Contacts`.
*What are Contacts in Canopy?*

A `Client` can be a business or an individual.  Regardless, there''s still _someone_ you''re going to contact regarding the deal or work to be performed.  The `Contact` list, is a list of individual human people, who can be assigned to a client.
This means a single contact can be for both Dave''s Doggy Diapers, as well as Dave F''s taxes.  I''m Dave :wave: ... the contact.

Contacts can be 1:many in Canopy.

I''ll be testing this evening, to see what the changes mean for our rollout.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-22T10:50:33+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-solutions-eas', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Hey Guys, Thought this was interesting. Creating a template for the FTA 843 for the associates to be able to start submitting, and this is in the IRM.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-09T16:18:19+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-solutions-eas', 'U096WS8LT3Q', '1. FTA is an administrative waiver and does not carry any oral statement authority (OSA) threshold. See _IRM 20.1.1.3.1_, Unsigned or Oral Requests for Penalty Relief, for OSA guidelines.
', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-09T16:18:21+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-solutions-eas', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Basically, when the IRs tells you the FTA is too high to do over the phone, they are lying.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-09T16:20:47+00:00'),
  ('nashville-tax-solutions-eas', 'deactivateduser804396', 'Huge find!!!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-09T16:21:55+00:00'),
