  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Hey guys, I started this so we can chat in real time if the need arises and you have a way to reach me', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-22T19:51:54+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'LETS GOOO', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-22T20:02:47+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Adam Barr', 'Hey Jace, For the client you were helping me with, Kenya Thronton. She just sent me this.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:39:33+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Adam Barr', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:39:50+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Adam Barr', 'She asked if our bookkeeper could help with it but it looks like really shady', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:40:23+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Bud, that is a mess, and it is more than a bookkeeper can handle. They need a whole new 990 and supporting documents about payroll, including hers that it appears she is overcharging for time compensation. Which is a big no no in the non-profit circle', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:45:00+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Adam Barr', 'Tell her it is too complex for a bookkepper?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:46:00+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Adam Barr', 'I''m guessing we dont want anything to do with it', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:46:20+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'We definetly can do the work, we cannot neg. in front of the Department of Public safety. But all the background work is tax related, which we can help with. It is not as simple as just getting a bookkeeper to look at it.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:52:32+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Look as it as a full audit, and tax return combined.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:53:04+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Plus entity work, as her members are not recognized based on the letter.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:53:50+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Its a massive project that would require a sizeable fee.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T13:54:07+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Adam Barr', 'Jace, Can you please email me an example of one of the penalty abatements you have done?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-23T20:14:34+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Sorry bud, my computer took a dump today and I had to do a hard reset. Still getting all my stuff downloaded. I will have a template that I can provide you, still trying to get all my old stuff', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-24T19:20:43+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', '@U096WS8LT3Q how should I proceed regarding Solensky? Was I supposed to get the EA to do something? TIA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T13:37:09+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Either you or him needs to draft a letter today stating we are working on the returns 19 &amp; 20, and include the 24 if he has sent it already. State the returns will be done in 30 days and then we will resolving the account at that time. Dont give her how we are doing it at this point, just that the resolution will occur once the returns are filed', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T13:42:42+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'You can also throw in she sent the wrong wage and income info on Thursday', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T13:42:58+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'Understood, ty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T13:46:43+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'No problem. ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T13:49:43+00:00'),
