  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'He takes a lot of the responsibility for the bad decision rightfully, but take on additional that this falls on, seems like he views it as a by product of his decision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T16:53:04+00:00'),
