  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'What about a buyers contract?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T19:26:56+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Instead of just SnA Assets list, request for all of them, in these long run we will need them all, SnA is just more pressing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T19:27:42+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'got it.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T19:28:04+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'And Buyer''s Contract seems like he is going through the landlord, so it is more than likely not in contract form as of yet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T19:31:46+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'got it', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-28T19:43:27+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'Hey, I was wondering how it works with CNC. Because I have a client who is CNC not due to hardship. I understand the difference between the two, I don''t understand the difference on how we acquire that for them if there isn''t hardship. Do we just ask the agent for it, fill out the form, falsity docs? (JK obvi). Thanks', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-29T14:29:50+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'No, You cant put them into the CNC not due to hardship', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-29T14:30:23+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'It is a "shelved" case, meaning they have not been able to proceed forward with the case', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-29T14:30:59+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'Hey Jace, I have a socorro file that I have to figure out. Not much to go off of Canopy, but it''s an innocent spouse. They denied it and she text John asking what''s up. I got her last week but haven''t made contact yet. She is asking abt an appeal. I need to build some rapport so I can ask for money. The packet that was sent to the IRS looks good. Anyways, I was going to email her since she''s in Colorado. Let me know what you think? TIA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-30T13:49:01+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Whats the clients name?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-30T13:49:27+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'Morgan Shaff', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-30T13:49:38+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'U096WS8LT3Q', 'Give me a few', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-30T13:50:16+00:00'),
  ('nashvilletaxsolutions-training-associates', 'Camille Loose', 'Hey good morning, just confirming. I should assign Fausto Augustine Onochie to call in the numbers but I should create the 433F first?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31T13:07:07+00:00'),
